  "implementation": "Reuse the existing nested SubCrv source/start/end getter, preview, directed-length confirmation and source admission. Command inputs are local temporary curves with original owner snapshots. Use the established native NURBS trim backend through a shared resolver callback; leave the existing mapping command resolver unchanged. Explicit portions replace whole selection of their owner, two portions of one owner are admitted, distinct owners follow document order and same-owner occurrences preserve argument order. End/KeepMarks emits only measurement marks in one undo edit.",
